# Telegram leech bot settings. The installer fills in the four required values below;
# change anything here with `leechbot settings` or by editing this file, then `leechbot restart`.

# --- required (set by the installer) ---
# API_ID=         from https://my.telegram.org -> API development tools
# API_HASH=       same page
# BOT_TOKEN=      from @BotFather
# OWNER_ID=       your numeric Telegram user ID; only this user can use the bot

# --- optional ---
# Use a disk-backed path. /tmp is often tmpfs (RAM-backed) and would eat your memory.
# DOWNLOAD_DIR=/var/tmp/leechbot

# Size of one Telegram upload (limit is 2000 MiB for non-Premium); bigger files are split.
# MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB=1990

# Largest total download to accept. Also capped automatically by the free disk space.
# MAX_DOWNLOAD_MB=8000

# Refuse to start a download if free disk would drop below this.
# MIN_FREE_MB=300

# yt-dlp always downloads the best quality. To prefer something else, give a yt-dlp format sort,
# e.g. res:1080 (cap at 1080p) or vcodec:h264 (plays inline in Telegram). Leave empty for "best".
# YTDL_SORT=

# Cookies for YouTube's bot check: normally managed with the /cookies command in Telegram.
# COOKIES_FILE=/opt/leechbot/cookies.txt
